omments/2836998707","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105735#issuecomment-2836998707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105735","id":2836998707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pGSoz","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T23:25:51Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T23:29:05Z","body":"https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_splitcontainer.html#class-splitcontainer-theme-style-split-bar-background\n\n`split_bar_background` is for the **split bar**, not the `SplitContainer`. There is nothing wrong with the description in the documentation. \n\nThe split bar is not visible when collapsed. It would seem possible to add a note to the description of the `collapsed` property to indicate that the split bar is hidden when enabled.\n\nWhat needs to be discussed is whether the split bar should be hidden when `collapsed` is enabled.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2836998707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]